# run: sed -n '/Graveyard Overdrive (m3c/,$p' deck.list | tail -n +2 | grep -v '^#' | grep -v '^$' > .ds4/scratch/m3c-graveyard-overdrive.list
# (tail -n +2 keeps the Commander/Deck headers; the section re-imports standalone with the commander recorded)
# 100/100 resolved; commander eligible (Legendary Creature). 1 new-gap ticket (.ds4/new-tickets/kw-cascade.md); kw-escape.md re-filed as a registration false gap (r2 review) — deck file NOT added.
# Gap primitives (7 of 91 cards / 3 primitives): kw:Cascade (Bloodbraid Elf, Bituminous Blast, Bloodbraid Challenger) — NEW, not in the ledger;
#   api:ImmediateTrigger and api:CopyPermanent are the open-ledger overlaps listed below. kw:Escape (Bloodbraid Challenger) is a FALSE gap of the
#   registration class: the escape cast IS implemented (rules/legal.go's graveyard-cast offer, rules/altcast.go escapeCost, exileCost in rules/mana.go,
#   state.FlagEscaped, pinned by rules/rakdos_params_escape_test.go) — only effects.RegisterNonAPI("kw:Escape") is missing (.ds4/new-tickets/kw-escape.md, corrected r2).
# Open-ledger overlaps (do not re-file): api:ImmediateTrigger (Grist the Hunger Tide, Ziatora the Incinerator, Riveteers Overlook) =
#   issue-agent-20260918T195920Z-2fd3b568 + issue-agent-20260918T202223Z-6ad7f5ec; api:CopyPermanent (Disa the Restless) =
#   issue-agent-20260918T200326Z-6994a692 + issue-agent-20260918T213512Z-bdef0f98.
# False gap: kw:Changeling (Graveshifter) — implemented at effects/filter.go hasType; only the RegisterNonAPI("kw:Changeling") line is missing.
# Invisible gap the primitive ratchet cannot see: Final Act's fifth Charm choice (Choices$ RemoveAllCounters) reaches an unregistered
#   api:RemoveCounter through an SVar body only — Primitives() walks Abilities/Triggers/Statics/Repls/Keywords, not Charm Choices$ SVars,
#   so the deck gap list shows Final Act clean while that mode is a guaranteed no-op. Ledger: issue-agent-20260918T202223Z-d6a3729d.
